{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>1. Escape Before It\u2019s Too Late!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3578350/extras/1Escape_Before_It\u2019s_Too_Late!.gif?t=1745323800\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The further you go, the stranger it gets. The only way out is through\u2014if you can trust what you see.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>2. Spot the Anomalies, All of them!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3578350/extras/S1pot_the_Anomalies__All_of_them!.gif?t=1745323800\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Something\u2019s wrong, but it\u2019s hard to say what. Look closely\u2026 the mistake might be looking back.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>3. Work Together or\u2026 Get Stuck!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3578350/extras/Work_Together_or\u2026_Get_Stuck!.gif?t=1745323800\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You\u2019ll need each other to move forward\u2014sometimes literally. Just hope your partner\u2019s seeing the same thing you are.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>4. Explore Every Corner &amp; Snap Creepy Photos!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3578350/extras/ExploreEveryCornerSnapCreepyPhotos-ezgif.com-video-to-gif-converter.gif?t=1745323800\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Don\u2019t just walk past that chair or maybe there is a problem with that sofa?! Take a picture before it moves again.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_